F  failure surface.
   2nd derivative (create_graph=True)             -> NotImplementedError: linear_solver='cudss' 的反向只做一阶：cuDSS 的三角回代不是 autograd 算子，create_graph=True / 二阶导数
   cudss + assemble='dense'                       -> ValueError: linear_solver='cudss' 必须配 assemble='csr'；收到 assemble='dense'
   cudss + float32 (differentiable path)          -> NotImplementedError: linear_solver='cudss' 本轮只接 float64，收到 torch.float32
   cudss + device='cpu' (differentiable path)     -> NotImplementedError: linear_solver='cudss' 需要 CUDA 设备，当前 device=cpu。本机无 CUDA 时请显式用 linear_solver='den
   cudss_grad_slots > cudss_cache_max             -> ValueError: cudss_grad_slots=8 大于 cudss_cache_max=2：LRU 会把先建的槽逐出，反向就落回重分解，多占的显存白花。请把 cudss_c
   cudss + mode='epanet'                          -> NotImplementedError: assemble='csr' 只对 mode='dense' 有效；mode='epanet' 是逐位复刻基准（自己的 smatrix 稀疏通路），不接受装配替
   cudss on a net with unsupported link types     -> NO RAISE  <-- inspect
   cudss forward under no_grad (must NOT raise)   -> NO RAISE  <-- inspect
   cudss backward with only demand requiring grad -> NO RAISE  <-- inspect

